# Searing Gorge - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Searing Gorge accept in the local census (39 quests,
# docs/searing-gorge-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept; 38
# turnins close every record that ends anywhere in the data, including
# four object turn-ins (the Torch, the Altar of Suntara, the Outhouse,
# the Hoard). Only 4264's Windsor turn-in has no placed end in the data
# (note-only, nothing invented). The Bodley endgame chain, the
# Attunement twins, Blackhand's Command, the four Thorium rep turn-ins,
# the Horde Kargath side (19 set aside) and the 1458 Mind of Metal are out
# with reasons in the census. No race header and no class gates: nothing
# contracted is race- or class-locked; profession lines are when-skill
# gated (Tailoring 230, Leatherworking 225, writs at 1 per the
# Thousand Needles pattern). Ungateable outside pres (3371 Ironforge for
# 3372, 4242 Burning Steppes for 4264) ride as structural warnings with
# the chain named. Expedition legs switch frames deliberately and switch
# back. The Lunar elder rides optional with its seasonal note.
guide butler-routes-completionist/searing-gorge
title Searing Gorge - Completionist
levels 40-52
zone Searing Gorge
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Thorium Point - arrival and the hub

  zone map 1427

  accept 7701 -- WANTED: Overseer Maltorius - the bounty board; Maltorius himself waits northeast
  accept 7722 -- What the Flux? - Master Smith Burninate; the plans have no placed source in the data - check the Slag Pit of the Cauldron per the objective text (honest note)
  complete 7722 -- What the Flux? (no placed source - honest note above)
  turnin 7722 -- What the Flux? - the word back to Master Smith Burninate
  accept 7723 -- Curse These Fat Fingers - Hansel Heavyhands; twenty Heavy War Golems
  accept 7724 -- Fiery Menace! - Hansel Heavyhands; twenty Greater Lava Spiders
  accept 7727 -- Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It - Hansel Heavyhands; twenty Incendosaurs
  accept 7728 -- STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass - the bounty board; a tuyere and a spyglass off Dark Iron crews
  accept 7729 -- JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition - the bounty board; Taskmasters and Slavers
  accept 7704 -- Look at the Size of It! - Evonice Sootsmoker; the pillow starter has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags
  accept 94275 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Solid Sharpening Stone - Master Smith Burninate; the writ has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags
  accept 94299 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Nightscape Shoulders - Evonice Sootsmoker; the writ has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags
  accept 94311 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Red Mageweave Pants - Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker; the writ has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags
  tip Thorium Point is the hub: the bounty board, the smiths and the flight point live here; the writs below are profession work (Blacksmithing, Leatherworking, Tailoring).

