  zone map 1427

  complete 7701 @40.77,35.89 -- Overseer Maltorius, northeast of the Point
  turnin 7701 -- WANTED: Overseer Maltorius - the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker
  complete 7723 @32.45,52.55 -- Heavy War Golems, west of the Point
  turnin 7723 -- Curse These Fat Fingers - the golem count to Hansel Heavyhands
  complete 7724 @22.03,77.29 -- Greater Lava Spiders, down in the Cauldron
  turnin 7724 -- Fiery Menace! - the spider count to Hansel Heavyhands
  complete 7727 @43.38,28.26 -- Incendosaurs, east of the Point
  turnin 7727 -- Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It - the scale count to Hansel Heavyhands
  complete 7728 @37.69,49.65 -- Smithing Tuyere off the Dark Iron Steamsmiths, north of the Point
  complete 7728 @32.49,54.86 -- Lookout's Spyglass off the Dark Iron Lookouts
  turnin 7728 -- STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass - both pieces to Taskmaster Scrange
  complete 7729 @34.28,46.33 -- Dark Iron Taskmasters and Slavers, north of the Point
  turnin 7729 -- JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition - the count to Taskmaster Scrange
  turnin 7704 -- Look at the Size of It! - the pillow to Evonice Sootsmoker

step Thorium Point - the hub writs

  zone map 1427

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  turnin 94275 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Solid Sharpening Stone - the writ and stone to Master Smith Burninate

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  turnin 94299 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Nightscape Shoulders - the writ and shoulders to Evonice Sootsmoker

  when skill Tailoring 1

  turnin 94311 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Red Mageweave Pants - the writ and pants to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker
  tip The writs' crafted pieces come from your profession; the starters have no placed source in the data.

