step Dying Archaeologist - release and obsidion

  zone map 1427

  accept 3372 -- Release Them - Dying Archaeologist; its pre (3371 Dwarven Justice, Ironforge) sits outside this route - structural, chain named. The Mysterious Artifact has no placed source anywhere in the data - have it in your bags (honest note)
  complete 3372 -- Release Them (no placed source - honest note above)
  turnin 3372 @41.25,25.41 -- Release Them - the word at the Altar of Suntara in the ruins
  accept 3566 -- Rise, Obsidion! - Dying Archaeologist; two heads off the north ruins
  complete 3566 @41.32,25.53 -- Head of Lathoric the Black, at the northern ruins
  complete 3566 @41.76,24.33 -- Heart of Obsidion, beside him
  tip Both turn-ins land with Curator Thorius in Ironforge - expedition below.

